   set subject = $LBTPL$post, cover, rate con, invoice — without re-typing anything$LBTPL$,
       html    = $LBTPL$<div style="display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden">A load entered once. Everything else is generated from it.</div><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#eef2f8;margin:0"><tr><td align="center" style="padding:26px 12px"><table role="presentation" width="620" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="max-width:620px;width:100%;background:#ffffff;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-family:'Segoe UI',Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif"><tr><td style="background:#10223B;padding:20px 34px" align="left"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td align="left"><img src="https://loadboot.com/email-logo-white-2x.png" width="146" alt="LoadBoot" style="display:block;border:0;max-width:146px;height:auto"></td><td align="right" style="font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.09em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8fb9e8;white-space:nowrap">Free for brokers</td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td style="height:3px;background:#0883F7;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#0883F7 0%,#0883F7 62%,#FC5305 100%);font-size:0;line-height:0">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:30px 34px 4px;color:#0f172a;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75"><p style="margin:0 0 16px">Hello {NAME},</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px">Most brokerage software problems are one problem: the load gets typed in four times. Once into the board, once into the rate confirmation, once into the TMS, once into the invoice. Every re-type is a chance for a city, a date or a rate to quietly change.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 18px">On LoadBoot a load is entered once. The rate confirmation is generated from it, the invoice is generated from the same record, and the carrier&rsquo;s paperwork attaches to it instead of arriving as an email somebody has to file. There is no per-post fee and no seat licence to argue about internally.</p><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#f6fafe;border:1px solid #d9e7f7;border-radius:12px;margin:4px 0 16px"><tr><td style="padding:14px 18px;font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#5b6b82"><b style="color:#10223B;font-size:14px">A broker account is free, permanently.</b><br>Unlimited posting, FMCSA-verified carriers, live GPS, rate con / BOL / POD on the load, and one-receipt payables &mdash; no subscription, no per-post fee, no card. LoadBoot is funded by a flat 5% dispatch fee on the <i>carrier</i> side; brokers are never billed.</td></tr></table><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin:2px 0 6px"><tr><td style="padding:0 0 14px"><div style="font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#5b6b82;padding-bottom:8px">Two ways in &mdash; take either</div><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border:1px dashed #b9d4f0;border-radius:12px;background:#ffffff"><tr><td style="padding:15px 18px"><div style="font-size:13px;color:#5b6b82;padding-bottom:4px">1 &mdash; Nothing to set up, no account:</div><div style="font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#10223B;letter-spacing:-.015em;line-height:1.3">cc loads@loadboot.com</div><div style="font-size:13px;color:#5b6b82;padding-top:4px">on the load list you already send your carriers. We read the lanes, equipment, dates and rate, post each load under your company, and reply if anything is missing.</div></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:0 0 4px"><div style="font-size:13px;color:#5b6b82;padding-bottom:9px">2 &mdash; Or take the whole screen &mdash; post, cover, rate con and invoice in one place:</div><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td style="background:#0883F7;border-radius:10px"><a href="https://loadboot.com/create-broker-account.html?utm_source=email&utm_medium=outreach&utm_campaign=broker-d6&oc={OC}" style="display:inline-block;padding:14px 30px;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:#ffffff !important;text-decoration:none;border-radius:10px"><span style="color:#ffffff !important;text-decoration:none">Create your free broker account</span></a></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:18px 34px 0"><div style="border-top:1px solid #e8eef6"></div></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:16px 34px 22px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.9;color:#475569"><b style="color:#10223B">LoadBoot &middot; Broker Desk</b><br><a href="https://loadboot.com?utm_source=email&utm_medium=outreach&utm_campaign=broker-d6&oc={OC}" style="color:#0883F7;text-decoration:none"><span style="color:#0883F7 !important;text-decoration:none">loadboot.com</span></a> &middot; +1 (469) 253-7575 &middot; available 24/7 &middot; reply to this email any time</td></tr><tr><td style="background:#f8fafc;padding:15px 34px 19px;font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.75;color:#8a94a6;border-top:1px solid #e8eef6">You are receiving this because {NAME} is listed on the public FMCSA register. If you would prefer not to hear from us, <a href="{UNSUB}" style="color:#8a94a6"><span style="color:#8a94a6 !important">unsubscribe with one click</span></a> and we will stop immediately.<br>LoadBoot LLC &middot; 30 N Gould St Ste N, Sheridan, WY 82801</td></tr></table></td></tr></table>$LBTPL$,
